    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What kind of game is this?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>This is a survivor like barrage shooting game. You need to choose weapons and enhancements to defeat waves of enemies, and persist for 20 minutes to achieve victory.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The weapon is automatic shooting, and WASD controls the movement of characters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Kill enemies and drop experience, pick up experience to gain upgrades, and then choose weapons or enhancements.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose up to 5 weapons, each weapon can be freely reinforced 8 times, and after full reinforcement, obtain an advanced effect.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are 10 different types of weapons with 70+different enhancements, and it is necessary to choose a reasonable construction method.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enemies with multiple characteristics will refresh random events in the later stage of the map, requiring reasonable response.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What kind of game is this?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>This is a survivor like barrage shooting game. You need to choose weapons and enhancements to defeat waves of enemies, and persist for 20 minutes to achieve victory.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The weapon is automatic shooting, and WASD controls the movement of characters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Kill enemies and drop experience, pick up experience to gain upgrades, and then choose weapons or enhancements.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose up to 5 weapons, each weapon can be freely reinforced 8 times, and after full reinforcement, obtain an advanced effect.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are 10 different types of weapons with 70+different enhancements, and it is necessary to choose a reasonable construction method.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enemies with multiple characteristics will refresh random events in the later stage of the map, requiring reasonable response.</li></ul>",
